# ======================
# HDDS Demos - .gitignore
# ======================

# --- Rust build artifacts ---
**/target/

# --- Node.js ---
**/node_modules/

# --- Web build output ---
**/dist/

# --- ESP-IDF build artifacts ---
**/.embuild/
**/build/
hdds-remote-sensor/archives/

# --- Generated code (regenerable via `make gen`) ---
**/generated.rs
**/*-types/src/lib.rs
**/*-types/src/mod.rs
**/*-viewer/src/types.ts
sentinel-home/sentinel-types/python/
sentinel-home/sentinel-types/typescript/

# --- Media (hosted on web, not in git) ---
videos/
screenshots/
images/
**/assets/raw/
space-invaders/assets/sprites/sprite_*.png

# --- WIP / planning docs ---
DEMO_NEXT.md
WIP_ROS2.md
**/README2.md

# --- Demos excluded (WIP / separate repos) ---
sentinel-home/
sentinel-demo/
uds-fleet-diag/

# --- Binary artifacts ---
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.o
*.obj
*.glb
# Exception: convoy-escort humvee model (196K, required for viewer)
!convoy-escort/convoy-viewer/public/assets/models/humvee.glb

# --- Vendored third-party libs (auto-installed by PlatformIO via lib_deps) ---
**/lib/EloquentEsp32cam/

# --- Lock files (regenerable) ---
**/package-lock.json

# --- Editor / OS junk ---
*.bak
*.orig
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Logs and runtime data ---
*.log
*.pid
*.lp

# --- IDE ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
